<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107828" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερπον-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>toil</i> or <i>labour beyond measure, undergo
				excessive strain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῷ πολέμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nic.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bear</i> or <i>endure for</i> others, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφὼ δ᾽ ἀντ᾽ ἐκείνων τἀμὰ δυστήνου
					κακὰ ὑπερπονεῖτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					345
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠδῖνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					717c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in 
				Med.
			 c. gen. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦδ᾽ ὑπερπονουμένῳ θανεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1310
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
